Z||000007||FieroKyle||12-28-2001||08:49 PM||||Yeah but thing about the "SHO"-offs and Probes is they think they are the total s$%t. Well most of them..... I pulled out of somewhere in my Fiero and this kid in a 1st generation probe flips me off. So I pulled off into the gas-station and asked me "whats your problem". Some lanky 120 lb 6'3'' 19 year old guy with a muscle tee shirt which just sort hanged there. I got out socked him one, and left. The funny part was his g/f was laughing. I think he had a problem with Fieros or something. What an ******* . There is a couple of kids with SHOs at school. Just a spunky soccer mom car in my opinion with bad looks.<P>I watch Conan a lot, he himself owns a Taurus. Hard to believe but he said he did on the show one time.<P>I don't know about an Probe GT easliy taking a Fiero GT. They run pretty much identical numbers on the 1/4. They are an alright car. They aren't nothing special though. They many in numbers and just a regular fwd vechile that looks somewhat sporty. Like an escort with flip up lights.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000008||TTiger||12-29-2001||12:09 AM||||I don't know.... I kinda liked the Probe that I had too- before a semi "relieved" me of the passenger side (also made it about 4 inches narrower).<P>92 Probe GT, 5 speed, full leather, power everything (including the moonroof), turbo 2.2L, excellent sound system too.  Paid $2500 for it, and I got to drive it for a month before it was wrecked.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Probe1-1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Probe2-2.jpg"> <P>My $.02<BR>Tony<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttigersig_21.gif"> ||||reg||1
