Z||000010||FieroKyle||12-29-2001||02:28 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>Kyle youve got issues man.  It sounds like you've gotten picked on a lot so I'm just gonna let this thread go.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Issues? I never said I hated them, never called them slow. I said pretty much it wasn't my favorite car but its not that bad. Sorta spunky with the GT version. I just said Conan sorta made a slam on them and thought it was funny. However I do hate kids who put other people down when they are totally far from "the **** " and they think they are.<P>If ya again wanna talk about issues, you have a real one with defending anything with a Ford badge. You let go nothing as matter of fact so I don't see you letting go of anything said about Fords on this forum. I never started picking on you through this post. Been keeping a cool head lately and you really have did that much lately and again start ****  here.||||reg||1
