Z||000014||tesmith66||12-30-2001||09:16 AM||||I hate to say this, but my wife's 96 Probe GT 5 speed will spank my 86 SE V6 silly. I really like the Probe. I think it is the "sexiest" looking car any American manufacturer dared to produce (I know it's a Mazda MX-6 GT in Ford clothing, but Ford actually did the design work for the interior and exterior).<P>------------------<BR>Timothy E. Smith<BR>1986 SE V6<BR>1984 Coupe||||reg||1
Z||000015||Fformula88||12-30-2001||11:26 AM||||This may cause some flames to errupt, but I am gonna have to say this.<P>I find it somewhat ironic that Fiero owners can sit around and trash a car like the Ford Probe.  They are not exactly direct competitors, but both cars are rather similar.  They were both meant to supply an affordable sporty car to the market... 4 banger versions leaning towards economy with V6's more towards sport... all affordable to most buyers. <P>I've owned two Probes, a 91 (1st gen) and my current daily driver is a 97 (2nd gen).  They are very well built and reliable... thanks to the Mazda drivetrain probably.  Performance in the V6's is very good, and with a competant driver a 2nd gen V6 will take a V6 Fiero.  The 1st gen Turbo 4's run about the same as the V6, but those engines tend not to be very reliable.  They also handle about as well as any sports coupe available when they were being built.  <P>I just don't see any one as being appreciably better than the other as an overall package.  I personally like driving the Fiero more because it feels more sporty (but not by too much), but the Probe offers a sporty drive as well with room to haul a bit more stuff!  ||||reg||1
Z||000016||BlackStang95||12-30-2001||01:51 PM||||That's what I was tryin to say...||||reg||1
Z||000017||FieroJoe||12-31-2001||12:10 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>That's what I was tryin to say...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I will agree with pretty much all that you have said BS, and I find it ironic that FieroKyle here found it necessary to tell us that he punched someone just becuase they flicked him off.  Thats total crap.  One thing I don't get about some FIERO owners is that they can't understand that not everybody is going to love thier car as much as they do.  I don't care if not everybody at school likes my car.  Most people don't know what the hell it is.  Its been called a Ferrari, a Porsche, and its even been asked of me if it was a Probe.  I like my car, and that's all I care about.  If someone starts bashing my car, I just laugh and walk away.  Maybe its because I am non-violent.  Maybe it's because I don't like to argue with idiots, becuase they only drag you down to thier level and then beat you with experience.||||reg||1
